                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Action/stealth game about a girl who, using hacking and sabotage, plans a brutal revenge against her father, the president\n\n\n✅I’m a huge fan of games where the player’s decisions have a real impact on the story and endings, that’s the biggest plus of this game\n✅For an RPG Maker game, the graphics look pretty good\n✅Variety of robots to control\n✅The price is fair \n✅Cinematic storytelling style (I love games like this <3)\n✅Combination of stealth and action , the gameplay isnt limited to just combat\n✅Very good music and sound effects that fit the game’s atmosphere\n\n❌The controls feel clunky due to stiff character movement and combat limitations\n❌Limited combat mechanics ,you cant shoot a gun from very close range\n❌Lack of diverse enemies\n❌You cant take screenshots \n\n✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [strike] Bad [/strike], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [b] Good [/b], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested game and indie games)\n\n[quote] If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]\n",
